      "text": "concerning his ignorance wherein he erred, Lev. 5:18. if ye have erred, and not observed, Num. 15:22. Manasseh made Judah … to err, 2 Chr. 33:9. people that do err in their heart, Ps. 95:10 (Heb. 3:10). proud … do err from thy commandments, Ps. 119:21. I erred not from thy precepts, Ps. 119:110. he that refuseth reproof erreth, Prov. 10:17. Do they not err that devise evil, Prov. 14:22. causeth to err from the words of knowledge, Prov. 19:27. they which lead thee cause thee to err, Isa. 3:12 (2 Ne. 13:12). leaders of this people cause them to err, Isa. 9:16 (2 Ne. 19:16). have erred through wine, Isa. 28:7. cause my people to err by their lies, Jer. 23:32.",
